eak to the manager?' → The customer asked","w":0.38666664123535155,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"if\/whether he could speak to the manager.","w":0.31777776718139639,"y":0.41265306123328727,"x":0.54222223149263504,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.54222222118299712,"y":0.43020408166886281,"w":0.42222221374511715,"text":"'Will you talk to Jen tonight?' → I asked him if\/whether he","h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.54222222786001684,"y":0.44326530617357607,"h":0.011836734693877693,"w":0.21111110687255852,"text":"would talk to Jen that night."},{"w":0.3977777862548828,"text":"• To report wh- questions, we keep the question word","x":0.52444444517811406,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.4607558141252297},{"text":"(e.g. what, who, how, where, when):","y":0.47510204070234208,"x":0.53777778362335882,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.2666666603088379},{"text":"'How many bottles of cola did you buy?' → I asked my son","y":0.49127907004819482,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.54222222960454658,"w":0.42666664123535158},{"w":0.31111110687255861,"text":"how many bottles of cola he had bought.","x":0.5399999969340914,"y":0.50436046497755993,"h":0.013190555183254959},{"y":0.5232558141252297,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"'When are you coming back?' → Dorothy wanted to know","x":0.54222222747222204,"w":0.42000000000000004},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"x":0.54000000906153245,"w":0.19333332061767583,"y":0.53632653053612822,"text":"when \/ was coming back."},{"w":0.10232498168945314,"y":0.56230479550595724,"text":"Imperatives","h":0.012018315840740534,"x":0.52439306573251443},{"y":0.57994186008414916,"w":0.41111110687255858,"text":"To report imperatives (orders or requests), we use verbs,","h":0.013119364368672226,"x":0.52444443986001732},{"x":0.52444445308223908,"y":0.59428571446357559,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.39111110687255857,"text":"such as ask or tell or other reporting verbs, an object"},{"text":"and (not) + to infinitive:","x":0.52444445096077474,"y":0.60897959170082061,"h":0.0087529661217514709,"w":0.18222221374511716},{"y":0.62489795899038492,"text":"'Please refund my money.' → The customer asked the","h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.39333332061767579,"x":0.52444445735782863},{"text":"manager to refund his money.","y":0.63953488392900881,"x":0.52444445045669208,"w":0.22666666030883775,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"y":0.65551020388228787,"x":0.52444444994444439,"text":"'Don't apply the cream more than twice a day.' - The shop","w":0.43999999999999995,"h":0.013094447388940944},{"x":0.52444444736599405,"y":0.67005813985197393,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.44444442749023438,"text":"assistant advised the customer not to apply the cream more"},{"text":"than twice a day.","x":0.52444444973446991,"y":0.68448979579749825,"w":0.12666666030883789,"h":0.011836734693877471}]